Subject: [PATCH] Introduce HideAppListUtils

Port only UN1CA's additional visibility/launch-denial hooks to the current
Android 17 control flow. Preserve PackageInfoList, every normal permission,
user-state, instant-app, sandbox, URI-grant, BAL and error-cleanup decision.
Resolve the PM caller from its snapshot, not a recursive public PM lookup;
keep self, root/system/shell, launcher and ordinary system-app exemptions.
The existing Play Store selection and media/service exclusions remain.
Ambiguous shared-UID identity keeps the platform's original visibility rules.
Never overwrite an unrelated R8 class or rewrite full query/launch methods.

